# Check text files out with LF on every machine, overriding Git for Windows' system-wide
# core.autocrlf=true. Bash scripts (WSLSetup.sh, .githooks/pre-commit) break with CRLF, and the
# apps behind the symlinked configs (Windows Terminal, VS Code, UniGetUI, ...) save LF anyway,
# which made git warn "LF will be replaced by CRLF" on every status.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.ptb binary
